<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: use poison bottle -->
  <Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Label>使用毒藥</Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Label>
  <!-- EN: Toggle the use of carried poison. When enabled, Kiiro will be able to apply poison to arrows or throwing weapons. Each shot consumes one unit of poison reserves. -->
  <Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Desc>切換是否使用隨身攜帶的毒藥。開啟后，當綺羅手持綺羅族的弓弩或暗器類武器時，能夠發射塗有毒藥的箭矢或飛鏢。每一次射擊消耗一點毒藥存量。</Kiiro_PoisonBottle_Desc>
  <!-- EN: stealth skill -->
  <Kiiro_StealthSkill_Label>潛行</Kiiro_StealthSkill_Label>
  <!-- EN: Toggle the stealth skill. When enabled, Kiiro is able to conceal their movements in dark or smoky environments. However, performing any attack action will break the stealth and expose them. -->
  <Kiiro_StealthSkill_Desc>切換潛行狀態。開啟后，綺羅能夠在黑暗或充滿煙霧的環境里隱藏自己的行蹤。做出攻擊行為會暴露。</Kiiro_StealthSkill_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: hostile -->
  <Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Label>綺羅關係：敵對</Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: Perceiving the hostility we have displayed, the Kiiros believe that towns exposed in our sight will no longer be safe. Kiiro messengers will spread the news of our hostile actions to all their towns for a certain period of time. -->
  <Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Desc>察覺到我們表現出的敵意，綺羅族認為暴露在我們視野中的城鎮將不再安全。綺羅的信使會在一段時間內將發現我們敵對行為的訊息傳達到她們的全部城鎮。</Kiiro_HostileToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: neutral -->
  <Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Label>綺羅關係：中立</Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: The relationship with the Kiiros has been restored to neutral. However, we have not gained their full trust, and until we demonstrate sufficient goodwill, the Kiiros will remain cautious of our actions. -->
  <Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Desc>和綺羅族的關係已經恢復至中立。我們並沒有獲得綺羅族的完全信任，在表達出足夠的善意之前，綺羅族仍然會警惕我們的行為。</Kiiro_NeutralToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro relationship: ally -->
  <Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Label>綺羅關係：盟友</Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Label>
  <!-- EN: We have allied ourselves with the kiiros, and they now consider us to be a trusted friend. Kiiro messengers will spread the news of our alliance to distant towns, which will take some time. -->
  <Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Desc>我們已經和綺羅族結為盟友，現在她們認為我們是值得信任的朋友。綺羅的信使會將結盟的訊息傳達到遠方的城鎮，這會花費一點時間。</Kiiro_AllyToKiiro_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro messengers are on their way -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Label>綺羅信使奔走中</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Label>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro messengers are running between the towns, spreading the news about our hostile actions. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc>綺羅信使正在奔走于各個城鎮之間傳達關於我們敵對行為的訊息。</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Progress of message delivery: -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc_Schedule>傳達訊息進度：</Kiiro_KiiroHide_Desc_Schedule>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro special forces raid -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Label>黑夜突襲</Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Label>
  <!-- EN: A small, highly trained elite special forces of Kiiros has launched a surprise attack under the cover of darkness! They will commence the assault immediately. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Desc>一支訓練有素的綺羅特戰隊趁著夜色發動了突襲！她們將立刻開始進攻。</Kiiro_KiiroNightRaid_Desc>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} has been abandoned. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_Label>{0_label}已經廢棄</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_Label>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} has disappeared from our map. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_A_Desc>{0_label}從我們的地圖上消失了。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_A_Desc>
  <!-- EN: {0_label} no longer exists, leaving behind only empty and deserted buildings in its place. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_B_Desc>{0_label}不復存在，原地只留下了空蕩蕩的房屋。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_B_Desc>
  <!-- EN: We have lost the location information of {0_label}. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_C_Desc>我們失去了{0_label}的位置資訊。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_C_Desc>
  <!-- EN: It appears that all the residents of {0_label} have already migrated, turning the town into an empty and abandoned city. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_D_Desc>{0_label}的居民似乎已經全部遷移，這座城鎮已然成為一座空城。</Kiiro_KiiroSettlementRemove_D_Desc>
  <!-- EN: All the Kiiro towns have disappeared -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Label>綺羅城鎮全部消失</Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Label>
  <!-- EN: All the Kiiro towns have become aware of our hostile actions, and we can no longer find any Kiiro settlements on the map. The Kiiros has severed all ties with us completely. -->
  <Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Desc>綺羅的全部城鎮都得知了我們的敵對行為，我們再也不能在地圖上找到任何一個綺羅族城鎮。綺羅族從此刻開始徹底與我們決裂。</Kiiro_KiiroFactionRemove_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Default -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_Initialization>恢復預設</Kiiro_Setting_Initialization>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro Race -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_Label>Kiiro Race</Kiiro_Setting_Label>
  <!-- EN: enable -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_True>啟用</Kiiro_Setting_True>
  <!-- EN: disable -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_False>禁用</Kiiro_Setting_False>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro faction interactions -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism>派系互動</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the entire faction interaction system, including mood, town abandonment, and special forces raids. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism_Desc>決定是否啟用包括心情、城鎮廢棄和特戰隊突襲在內的整個派系互動機制。僅推薦在產生模組衝突時關閉。\n\n在啟用綺羅事件拓展后，該選項會同時決定多種事件能否觸發，推薦開啟以獲得事件拓展的全部體驗。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenMechanism_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Town abandonment -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove>城鎮廢棄</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the Kiiro faction town abandonment system. When enabled, Kiiro towns will gradually disappear as the duration of faction hostility increases. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove_Desc>決定是否啟用綺羅族城鎮廢棄系統。開啟后，綺羅族的城鎮將隨派系敵對時長的增加而逐漸消失。僅推薦在產生模組衝突時關閉。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenFactionRemove_Desc>
  <!-- EN: night raid -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid>黑夜突襲</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether to enable the Special Forces Raid event. Only recommended to disable when mod conflict occurs. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid_Desc>決定是否啟用特戰隊突襲事件。僅推薦在產生模組衝突時關閉。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenNightRaid_Desc>
  <!-- EN: AI uses poison bottle -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle>AI使用毒藥瓶</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle>
  <!-- EN: Decide whether non-player factions of the Kiiro can use poison bottles. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle_Desc>非玩家派系的綺羅是否能夠使用毒藥瓶。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OpenPoisonBottle_Desc>

  <!-- EN: Kiiro Apparel Restrict -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OnlyUseRaceRestrictedApparel>綺羅服裝限制</Kiiro_Setting_If_OnlyUseRaceRestrictedApparel>
  <!-- EN: Decide if the kiiro can only wear apparels within the restrictons.\n\nExperimental function. When disabled, kiiro will be able to wear any apparel. Not responsible for any possible conflicts or errors. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_OnlyUseRaceRestrictedApparel_Desc>決定綺羅族是否僅能著裝限定範圍內的服裝。\n\n實驗性功能。禁用后，綺羅族將可以著裝任意服裝。不對任何可能出現的衝突或錯誤負責。</Kiiro_Setting_If_OnlyUseRaceRestrictedApparel_Desc>
  
  <!-- EN: Shella Background Storyteller Texture -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_UseShellaStoryTellerTex>Shella聯動敘事者裝束</Kiiro_Setting_If_UseShellaStoryTellerTex>
  <!-- EN: Whether to enable Shella background-style kiiro storyteller texture. Restart to apply the changes. -->
  <Kiiro_Setting_If_UseShellaStoryTellerTex_Desc>是否啟用Shella背景聯動的綺羅敘事者裝束。需要重啟遊戲。</Kiiro_Setting_If_UseShellaStoryTellerTex_Desc>


  <!-- EN: melee dodge rate -->
  <StatsReport_KiiroRangeDodge>近戰閃避機率</StatsReport_KiiroRangeDodge>
</LanguageData>